Sval: Draw Settings' search box as a sval-field

Settings is a Sval surface, so a Firefox style on one of Settings'
controls is a bug. sval-field draws the search box with Sval's roles, and
findInPage.js and preferences.js get the value, input event, focus() and
updateComplete they use.

diff --git a/browser/components/preferences/preferences.xhtml b/browser/components/preferences/preferences.xhtml
index 98af6f0adb..8f4668f23a 100644
--- a/browser/components/preferences/preferences.xhtml
+++ b/browser/components/preferences/preferences.xhtml
@@ -211,8 +211,9 @@
             iconsrc="chrome://global/skin/icons/organizational-unit.svg"
             data-l10n-id="managed-notice-nav"
           />
-          <html:moz-input-search
+          <html:sval-field
             id="searchInput"
+            type="search"
             data-l10n-id="search-input-box2"
             data-l10n-attrs="placeholder"
           />
